	•	Add detailed logging for each robot’s position and velocity.
	•	Experiment with slightly modifying the mass or friction properties to see if the behavior evens out.

This detailed interplay of docking order, numerical solver behavior, and the physical properties of the robots is most likely why Spirit 0’s position is the most affected in your simulation.